  <page>
    <title>OKW (disambiguation)</title>
    <id>179781</id>
    <revision>
      <id>28382596</id>
      <timestamp>2005-11-15T09:17:00Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <username>D. F. Schmidt</username>
        <id>321437</id>
      </contributor>
      <minor />
      <comment>[[OKW]] moved to [[OKW (disambiguation)]]</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''OKW''' is a [[TLA]] (three-letter acronym) and it has multiple meanings:
* OKW most notably stands for [[Oberkommando der Wehrmacht]] - the high Command of the [[Nazi Germany|Third Reich]] armed forces.
* The much older post-nominal letters; OKW, stand for ''Old King William's'' - former pupils, staff and governors of [[King William's College#Noted alumni|King William's College]]; a school in the [[Isle of Man]].
* OKW also stands for [[Disney's Old Key West Resort|Old Key West]] - a resort in the [[Walt Disney World Resort|Disneyworld]], [[Florida]].

{{disambig}}</text>
    </revision>
  </page>
